{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06362","headline":"送崔侍御赴京 · 李颀","name":"送崔侍御赴京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿槐荫长路，骏马垂青丝。\n柱史谒承明，翩翩将有期。\n千官大朝日，奏事临赤墀。\n肃肃仪仗里，风生鹰隼姿。\n一从登甲科，三拜皆宪司。\n按俗又如此，爲郎何太迟。\n送君暮春月，花落城南陲。\n惜别醉芳草，前山劳梦思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06362.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06362","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}